Unc and Phew were really in their bag on this “Big Stunna” by Quavo and Takeoff featuring Birdman is a standout collaboration that showcases the incredible chemistry between the two Migos members. Released in 2022 as a single from their collaborative album Only Built for Infinity Links, the track is driven by a heavy, bouncing trap production that gives both artists plenty of room to lock into their flows.

Which project would you put up against this?

